  "model": {
    "note": "ranges.json (PR #16 v1.1) values. Before the failure, life support is regulated (net 0): production covers consumption, removal covers production, cabin values stay constant; only the failing gas moves. Volume 75 m³. Times are aligned with the #14 atmosphere engine in the same model (regulated profile); tests/test_scenarios.py compares the cabin series with the engine.",
